  text: "Hi Bob,\n\nFriday works for me. The new place on the corner has a lunch menu, see \nhttps://lunch.example.com/menu - shall we meet there at noon? If it is \nfull we can still go to the usual one.\n\nOn 06.03.25 18:01, Bob Builder wrote:\n> Are you free for lunch on Friday? I could do 12 or 13.\n>\n>> Anna wrote earlier:\n>> Let's catch up soon!\n\n-- \nAnna Example\nExample Corp | anna@example.com\n"
